%T A398930 23
%N A398930 The smallest prime divisor of Sum_{k=1..n} k^(k^k).
%C A398930 a(30) > 10^11.
%H A398930 Mathematics Stack Exchange, <a href="https://math.stackexchange.com/questions/671632/prime-factors-of-sum-k-130kkk">Prime factors of Sum_{k=1..30} k^k^k</a>.
%e A398930 For n = 6, a(n) = 733 because 1^1^1+2^2^2+3^3^3+4^4^4+5^5^5+6^6^6 = 733 * 15259 * 2377430618...23.
%t A398930 a[n_]:=(p=2;
%t A398930 While[Mod[Total[Table[PowerMod[k,k^k,p],{k,n}]],p]!=0,p=NextPrime[p]];
%t A398930 p);Table[a[n],{n,2,20}]
